From 30fa58d8618f5fa39b2d866d5d4312c9265cac15 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Go Kudo <zeriyoshi@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 03:26:22 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] avfilter: add libhdrgrading filter

Grade SDR video into single-layer PQ HDR over BT.2020 with libhdrgrading
(https://github.com/zeriyoshi/libhdrgrading). Each output frame carries the
mastering display and its own HDR10+ and SMPTE ST 2094-50 metadata.

The filter holds the frames of its statistics window and sends them on at
the end of the stream; it can change the output size and frame rate (the
frames between interpolated by the library).
---
